message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "UpliftBench: Revealing Outcome-Regime and Objective Mismatch in Uplift Evaluation"
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Binshuang"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-3643-747X"
version: "1.4.0"
date-released: "2026-07-24"
